Presentation Layer: src/App.tsx (3.327 dòng), src/components/canvas/DesignCanvas.tsx (3.301 dòng), Network3DScene.tsx (2.973 dòng), src/cad/components/*, src/components/properties/*, src/components/modals/*.
State / Application Layer: Custom hook store src/store/useProjectStore.ts (1.620 dòng) ghép 4 slice (useUIStateSlice, useNodesSlice, useCablesSlice, useProjectSettingsSlice) + ViewportContext + useCADController. Không dùng Zustand/Redux.
Engineering Core: Nằm rải trong src/utils/: engineeringValidator.ts (1.392 dòng), bomAggregator.ts (1.644 dòng), cableRouting.ts, poeCalculator.ts, portCompatibility.ts, ipAutoAssign.ts, rackGeometry.ts, rackAirflow.ts, tia606.ts.
Off-thread Workers: src/workers/infrastructureCompute.worker.ts, cableRender.worker.ts, src/cad/workers/cadImport.worker.ts, src/utils/computeWorkerClient.ts.
